         cols: Daily, Weekly, Monthly, Every Semester, Rarely or Never
         rows: A group chat or message board (e.g. Discord or Reddit), A podcast or vlog (video blog) post, Notes on a lecture or passage, Poetry or song lyrics, A physical note (short message) or letter
       </TabularMCQ>
       <Markdown>
         Select one option for each row. Your selections are automatically saved.
